# --- Local profile data (never commit) ---
# Created by Guide on first run (see root AGENTS.md, First-run onboarding).
# Holds the user's name, org name/mission, and task interest -- personal
# workspace data, not something that belongs in a shared/public repo.
.profile.yaml

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Secrets (never commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# --- Logs & runtime state ---
*.log
tmp/
